<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?><kml xmlns="http://www.opengis.net/kml/2.2"><Document><name>11/15 福岡四週年旅遊</name><Placemark><name>A · 博多都酒店</name><description>09:30–11:00｜飯店內：早餐、整理行李、退房。｜概略位置，請核對實際店址</description><Point><coordinates>130.4228429,33.5897507,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>B · ONE FUKUOKA HOTEL</name><description>11:00–12:00｜帶行李推薦計程車約 12–20 分；地鐵博多→天神＋步行約 15–25 分。｜概略位置，請核對實際店址</description><Point><coordinates>130.4000978,33.5908005,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>D · ONE FUKUOKA HOTEL</name><description>14:00–16:30｜午餐店址未定；原稿回飯店步行 5–15 分為暫估。｜概略位置，請核對實際店址</description><Point><coordinates>130.4000978,33.5908005,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>G · ONE FUKUOKA HOTEL</name><description>20:30 後｜從晚餐返回飯店的時間待地址確認。｜概略位置，請核對實際店址</description><Point><coordinates>130.4000978,33.5908005,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark></Document></kml>